  "description": "TRIAL EDITION. General SQL Parser .NET parses, analyzes, modifies and formats SQL from 15 database vendors (Oracle, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Snowflake, Teradata, DB2, Hive, Impala, Greenplum, Redshift, Netezza, Informix, Sybase, MDX). This trial build refuses any SQL longer than 10,000 characters: parse() returns -1 and Errormessage explains the limit. Everything else behaves exactly as the full edition. For the unrestricted library see https://www.sqlparser.com.",
